      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Factories, houses, bunkers, camps and ships dot the Overworld, and their chests hold GregGuns gear you would otherwise have to craft. Each structure draws from loot tables with a tier ceiling. In the Overworld the small ruins stop at LV and everything bigger stops at MV, so a trip is worth it at any stage but never hands you the next tier early.\n\nStructures also spawn on Ross128b and its moon, where each one rolls its own ceiling and can hold far better loot. An admin can turn any of them off in the worldgen section of the GregGuns config. Vanilla chests fill when the world generates; Weapon and Reinforced chests fill the first time someone opens them.\n\nEach quest in this chapter asks you to bring back something you can find there. Craftable items count too, so you can also build your way through, but the loot is free.\n\n[note]Go armed: carry a Hand Cannon and some stone bullets before you leave the base.[/note]",
